Isso 0.14.0 -- https://isso-comments.de -- https://github.com/isso-comments/isso

assets/css/isso.css is the upstream stylesheet from Isso 0.14.0, vendored verbatim so it
can go through Hugo Pipes. It is not modified here; overrides live in the .comments
block in assets/css/main.css.

